          "thread": "US stablecoin Eurozone sovereignty threat",
          "why": "The scenario of dollar-backed crypto draining EU capital and weakening ECB monetary control pulled the single highest-clicked headline and anchored multiple follow-ons, making it the defining reader anxiety on this topic."
