          "thread": "Digital euro timeline and political resistance",
          "why": "Readers tracked every milestone — Lagarde's October 2025 readiness claim, the pivotal 2026 parliamentary vote, and the 2029 targeted rollout — while also clicking on the pushback from banks, conservatives, and French and German lawmakers favoring Bitcoin instead."
